parslinux-amd-intel-installer (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of ParsLinux AMD & Intel Installer.
  * Modern AMD Radeon and Intel graphics architecture support.
  * Automatic hardware detection, Vulkan layers and VA-API hardware video acceleration.
  * Hybrid GPU power profiles (DRI_PRIME) and compute environments.
  * Polkit and GTK4 modern interface integration.

 -- ParsLinux Developers <dev@parslinux.org>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0300
